  "description": "Batch-analyzes every system and personal view (savedquery / userquery) in a table: runs each view's FetchXML through the shared performance rule engine (all-attributes, missing filters, excessive/outer joins, link-entity sorts, aggregation/paging) and adds LayoutXML column analysis to flag over-wide grids. Ranks the slowest/riskiest views by a labeled heuristic cost score, shows per-view FetchXML, layout columns and findings, offers opt-in read-only execution timing, and exports Excel/PDF/JSON/HTML/Markdown/CSV. Reuses the FetchXML Performance Analyzer engine. Read-only.",
